So a full "document" canonicalization function must reconstruct typed values: version/seed/state/revision/wallet_gold/basket_capacity/wait_seconds (when non-null)/sale_price_at_catch/x/y/width/height/candidate.version → int; now/elapsed/caught_at_clock → float.

